{"id":"n15989-1-15","stage":0,"title":"멋있다 · 帅气","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15989-1-15-1","ko":"새로 산 양복인데 멋있지?","zh":"这是新买的西装，很帅吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"양복인데","meaning":"西装","explanation":"양복：西装；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"양복","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73257","senseId":"1","lemma":"양복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멋있지?","meaning":"帅气，优秀","explanation":"멋있다：帅气，优秀；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15989","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"c7bd572874f1f999","term":"양복","zh":"西装","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3","entryId":"73257","definition":"成年男子的西洋式正装。","pronunciation":["양복"]},{"id":"79ca95990baff4c4","term":"멋있다","zh":"帅气，优秀","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3","entryId":"15989","definition":"很好或很出众。","pronunciation":["머딛따","머싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2ef75532cb6d31ec75e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15989-1-15-2","ko":"정말 멋있네. 어디서 샀니?","zh":"真的非常帅。是在哪儿买的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멋있네.","meaning":"帅气，优秀","explanation":"멋있다：帅气，优秀；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15989","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀니?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"79ca95990baff4c4","term":"멋있다","zh":"帅气，优秀","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3","entryId":"15989","definition":"很好或很出众。","pronunciation":["머딛따","머싣따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/18b79402f3ed66dd1b44.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.66,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15989","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":24,